<title>USA: Battle Mountain exploration budget $35 mln.</title>
<headline>Battle Mountain exploration budget $35 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Battle Mountain Gold Co said on Monday it will spend about $35 million on exploration in 1997, and expects total gold production to be about 920,000 ounces.</p>
<p>Among the high-priority exploration targets are properties at El Cairo in Mexico, Dunkwa in Ghana and Volta Grande in Brazil, it said.</p>
</text>
